# /crates/offgrd-driver/            @offgrd-dog/kernel-reviewers

# Detection rules: security-content reviewers (may differ from code reviewers)
/rules/                             @offgrd-dog/detection-engineers

# Docs/architecture: lower barrier, anyone with write access can review
/docs/                              @offgrd-dog/maintainers
